        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "47. Employees who are promoted shall undergo a ninety (90) day evaluation period in the new position. Should the employee fail to qualify for the new position he/she shall be returned to his/her former comparable position without change in his/her previous seniority wage rate. Such rights to return shall be given preference in filling open positions.",
