        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "49. The Employer will provide one (1) copy of the request for transfer to the Union, or its designee, at the time it is processed. The Employer shall maintain a file of such requests and shall provide such names to supervisors in departments where vacancies occur.",
