        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "50. An employee, including new hires, who applies for and is awarded a posted position in a different department may not apply for another vacancy in a different department for six (6) months, unless the vacancy results in a promotion. This bidding restriction shall not apply to changes in position, classification shift, or scheduled hours within the same department or to employees whose hours have been reduced by the Employer. It shall also be waived by the Employer prior to considering outside applicants.",
